Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 15:29:13 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add Uma Musume (JP) bundle decryption

- New game entry "Uma Musume (JP)".
- Reads the encrypted meta database through SQLite3 Multiple Ciphers
  (ChaCha20) to map hash-named dat files to names, dependencies and
  per-file keys.
- Decrypts bundles in PreProcessing (XOR from offset 256), unencrypted
  or unlisted files pass through unchanged.
- Keys are read from UmaKeys.json so they can change without a rebuild.
- GUI: File > Load Uma Musume asset... loads assets by name prefix
  together with all of their dependencies.

Encryption scheme and keys as implemented by UmaViewer.

